    <briefdescription>
<para>自适应扩容的动态缓冲区 </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>适用于异步读取场景：prepare() 获取可写区域，commit() 标记已填充， <ref refid="classneforce_1_1dynamic__buffer_1adf92915f3469913b2562f87bd4584d73" kindref="member">consume()</ref> 移除已处理数据。内部自动扩容。</para>
<para>使用示例： <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal">dynamic_buffer<sp/>buf;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">sock.async_read(ctx,<sp/>buf.prepare(1024),<sp/>[&amp;](error_code<sp/>ec,<sp/></highlight><highlight class="keywordtype">size_t</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>n)<sp/>{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>buf.commit(n);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>process(buf.data(),<sp/>buf.size());</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>buf.consume(processed);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">});</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>prepare/commit/consume 操作不保证线程安全，调用者负责同步。 </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
